From a162ca2e6dfd91adc36aef79875f198fc0fcd151 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Keith Packard <keithp@keithp.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 23:58:02 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/5] test-posix: Check threads.h, C11 thread results,
 destructors and cancellation

Check the header's types, constants and prototypes; which result the
mtx_, cnd_ and thrd_ functions give; recursive lock counts; waits that
signals interrupt; thrd_sleep's remaining time and errors; thrd_exit
from the initial thread; tss destructor rounds; and cnd_wait,
cnd_timedwait, thrd_join and thrd_sleep as the only cancellation
points.
